### =========================
### WORKOUT FLOW
### =========================

### Create Workout (linked to Trainer 1)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/workouts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Push Day",
  "description": "Chest + Triceps",
  "trainerId": 1
}

###

### Create another Workout
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/workouts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Pull Day",
  "description": "Back + Biceps",
  "trainerId": 1
}

###

### Create Workout for Trainer 2
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/workouts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Leg Day",
  "description": "Quads + Hamstrings",
  "trainerId": 2
}

###

### Get all workouts
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/workouts

###

### Get workout by id
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/workouts/1

###

### Update workout
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/workouts/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Push Day UPDATED",
  "description": "Chest + Shoulders",
  "trainerId": 1
}

###

### Delete workout
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/v1/workouts/2

###

### Get all workouts again
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/workouts


